{"title": "远程验证：1130 被拒 → 授权 → 闭环", "lines": [
  {"t": "out", "s": "ERROR 1130 (HY000): Host 'mclient.v4net' is not allowed"},
  {"t": "out", "s": "to connect to this MariaDB server"},
  {"t": "config", "s": "GRANT ALL ON *.* TO 'root'@'%' IDENTIFIED BY 'root';"},
  {"t": "config", "s": "ALTER USER 'root'@'localhost' IDENTIFIED BY 'root';"},
  {"t": "config", "s": "FLUSH PRIVILEGES;"},
  {"t": "cmd", "s": "mysql -h <服务器IP> -uroot -proot -e \"select current_user();\""},
  {"t": "out", "s": "current_user()"},
  {"t": "out", "s": "root@%"},
  {"t": "note", "s": "授权前 1130（没有 root@% 行），授权后远程列出库，闭环"},
  {"t": "note", "s": "实测环境：Rocky 9.3 双容器网络 (mariadb 10.5.29)"}
]}
